* 図13: series L 43n / shunt C 2.5p / series R 51 / short
Vs_10 s_10 0 AC 1
Rs_10 s_10 n0_10 50
L1_0_10 n0_10 n1_10 4.300000000e-08 Rser=1u
C2_0_10 n1_10 0 2.500000000e-12
R3_0_10 n1_10 n2_10 5.100000000e+01
Rend_10 n2_10 0 1u
.meas AC a10_0 FIND V(n0_10) AT 3000000
